OL,3,GNEWSACost of living on many minds ahead
OL,4,Aof Manx election
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents, businesses, and charities
OL,7,Fsay they are feeling the pinch of
OL,8,Frising costs, with many describing the
OL,9,Feconomy as a key priority ahead of the
OL,10,FIsle of Man general election.
OL,12,FSeveral independent shops in Ramsey
OL,13,Fsaid custom was down and running costs
OL,14,Fhad become harder to manage, while the
OL,15,Fisland's foodbank said demand for
OL,16,Fsupport had doubled in two years.
OL,18,FThe Isle of Man Chamber of Commerce
OL,19,Fwarned the Island faced "a very hard
OL,20,Ffive years" ahead, citing a shrinking
OL,21,Ftax base and the recent loss of many
OL,22,Fhighb@Qearning jobs.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
