OL,3,GNEWSACost of living on many minds ahead
OL,4,Aof Manx election
OL,5,
OL,6,FCandidates have been urged to explain
OL,7,Fhow they will fund their plans, support
OL,8,Fbusinesses, and reduce the pressures on
OL,9,Fworking families.
